{"id":1490,"title":"什么是Python的切片？","summary":"什么是Python的切片？","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"77826455-1799-3476-980e-f8bdfcbce50c","knowledge_id":172,"title":"什么是Python的切片？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":172,"title":"什么是Python的切片？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"726a4727-c683-3dcc-af28-f17e2085aa2f","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在 Python 中，切片是从列表中获取部分元素的方法。\n\n可以通过在列表的末尾添加方括号 `[]` 来切分字符串或列表。在 `[]` 中：\n\n- 第一个值称为**起始索引**。\n- 第二个值称为**结束索引**。\n- 最后一个值称为**间隔**。\n- 每个值之间用`:`符号分隔。\n\n让我们来看一个例子：","text_html":"<p>在 Python 中，切片是从列表中获取部分元素的方法。</p>\n<p>可以通过在列表的末尾添加方括号 <code>[]</code> 来切分字符串或列表。在 <code>[]</code> 中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>第一个值称为<strong>起始索引</strong>。</li>\n<li>第二个值称为<strong>结束索引</strong>。</li>\n<li>最后一个值称为<strong>间隔</strong>。</li>\n<li>每个值之间用<code>:</code>符号分隔。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>让我们来看一个例子：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ad0b4f19-a25f-31cd-829b-08f5fb07dbcd","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"my_list = [22, 33, 55, 66, 77, 99]\nprint(my_list[:])   \t# 打印整个列表\nprint(my_list[1:3]) \t# 打印索引1和2处的元素\nprint(my_list[1:5:2])   # 打印从索引1到索引4的元素，间隔为2\nprint(my_list[:2])  \t# 打印索引1（包括索引1）之前的元素","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"027","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/027/page/1490"}
